文のパターンね。
It's a sentence pattern.

1320
01:11:08,848 --> 01:11:10,448
えーと、これは、パターンは...
Um, this pattern is...

1321
01:11:10,548 --> 01:11:11,148
can

1322
01:11:11,248 --> 01:11:15,748
えーと、Whereとか、疑問のWが冒頭にあって、はてながあるやつ。
Um, starting with a "W" question word like "where", followed by a question mark.

1323
01:11:15,848 --> 01:11:17,048
When...

1324
01:11:17,248 --> 01:11:18,548
can...

1325
01:11:18,748 --> 01:11:19,848
